        <hr noshade size="1">
        
        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> <BLOCKQUOTE id=quote><font size=1 face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" id=quote>quote:<hr height=1 noshade id=quote><BR>It LOOKS great, but I worry about how it would be implemented.  Too many games have come out that looked great but had terrible mechanics.<BR><hr height=1 noshade id=quote></BLOCKQUOTE id=quote></font id=quote><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size=2 id=quote></P><P>Bad news, Braxzana, the FAQ as much as says there will be mandatory grouping.  As they say, tabletop D&D is based around a group of adventurers rather than soloing.  They also promise that it will be easy to find a group and there will be no having to wait two hours LFG.  I think their FAQ also claims they have the genetic blueprints to give pigs wings and new thermodynamic principles to allow the making of snowballs in the underworld.  <img src=icon_smile_wink.gif border=0 align=middle></P><P>Who knows?  With the game this far off, it's hard to know what will happen to it, but at least it looks promising.</P><P></P><P>Inferna 47 Mage<BR><a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
